<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>(주)엠밸리테크 - 카테고리</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; }
  body { background-color: #f8fafc; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
  .layer-1 { width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 2px solid #0f4c81; }
  .main-banner { width: 100%; height: 350px; background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.55), rgba(0,0,0,0.55)), url('https://github.com/GlassBird210/mvalleytech/blob/main/public/MVT-EX/mainbanner.jpg') center/cover no-repeat; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 0 15px; cursor: pointer; }
  .main-banner h1 { font-size: 54px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
  .main-banner p { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 300; margin-top: 8px; opacity: 0.9; }
  .gnb-menu { display: flex; justify-content: center; background-color: #0f4c81; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .gnb-btn { padding: 14px 24px; color: #ffffff; background: transparent; border: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .gnb-btn:hover, .gnb-btn.active { background-color: #0b3860; color: #ffd700; }
  .layer-2 { width: 100%; background-color: #e2e8f0; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; min-height: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; }
  .sub-menu-group { display: none; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 15px; }
  .sub-menu-group.active { display: flex; }
  .sub-btn { padding: 6px 16px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 13.5px; color: #334155; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; transition: all 0.2s; text-decoration: none; }
  .sub-btn:hover, .sub-btn.active { background-color: #0f4c81; color: #ffffff; border-color: #0f4c81; font-weight: 500; }
  .search-container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 20px auto; display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; padding: 0 10px; }
  .search-box { width: 100%; max-width: 500px; display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
  .search-select { padding: 9px 14px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0f4c81; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; outline: none; background-color: #fff; cursor: pointer; }
  .search-input { flex: 1; padding: 9px 14px; font-size: 14px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; outline: none; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); transition: border-color 0.2s; }
  .search-input:focus { border-color: #0f4c81; }
  .sub2-menu-box { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 18px; align-items: center; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1.5px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 14px; }
  .sub2-btn { background: none; border: none; color: #475569; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .sub2-btn:hover, .sub2-btn.active { color: #0f4c81; font-weight: 700; background-color: #e2e8f0; }
  .sub2-divider { color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; }
  .layer-3 { width: 100%; padding: 25px 20px 50px 20px; min-height: 500px; position: relative; }
  .content-panel { display: none; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-in-out; }
  .content-panel.active { display: block; }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(5px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  .card-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 22px; }
  @media (max-width: 992px) { .card-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 18px; } :global(.card-img) { height: 250px; } }
  @media (max-width: 576px) { .card-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 15px; } :global(.card-img) { height: 300px; } }
  :global(.card) { border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; background: #fff; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); display: flex; flex-direction: column; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; }
  :global(.card:hover) { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
  :global(.card-img) { display: block; width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; background-color: #f1f5f9; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
  :global(.card-body) { padding: 18px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
  :global(.card-title) { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f4c81; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.3; }
  :global(.card-info) { font-size: 13.5px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  :global(.card-info span) { font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; display: inline-block; width: 30px; }
  :global(.board-table) { width: 100%; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-collapse: collapse; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); margin-top: 15px; }
  :global(.board-table th) { border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: #0f4c81; color: #fff; padding: 14px; font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; text-align: center; }
  :global(.board-table td) { border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: #334155; }
  :global(.board-table td.b-title) { text-align: left; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s; }
  :global(.board-table td.b-title:hover) { color: #0284c7; text-decoration: underline; }
  .quote-wrap { background: #ffffff; padding: 35px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); }
  .quote-row { margin-bottom: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .quote-label { width: 140px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; color: #334155; }
  .quote-input { flex: 1; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; outline: none; }
  .privacy-box { background: #f8fafc; padding: 18px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 25px; }
  .privacy-scroll { height: 140px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 4px; background: #ffffff; font-size: 13px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.7; margin: 12px 0; }
  .quote-submit-btn { width: 100%; padding: 16px; background: #0f4c81; color: #fff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border: none; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; }
  footer { background-color: #1e293b; color: #94a3b8; padding: 40px 20px 30px 20px; font-size: 13px; border-top: 1px solid #334155; }
  .footer-container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; }
  .footer-bank { background: #334155; padding: 15px 20px; border-radius: 8px; color: #f1f5f9; }
  .copyright { max-width: 1200px; margin: 25px auto 0 auto; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #334155; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="layer-1">
    <div class="main-banner" onclick="location.href='/'" title="홈으로 이동">
      <h1>(주)엠밸리테크</h1>
      <p>세계일류를 꿈꾸는, 능동적이고 적극적인 개척정신</p>
    </div>
	<div class="gnb-menu">
	  <button class="gnb-btn active" onclick="location.href='/category/all'">제품소개</button>
	  <button class="gnb-btn" onclick="location.href='/board/category/all'">기술자료</button>
	  <button class="gnb-btn" onclick="location.href='/quote'">견적문의</button>
	  <button class="gnb-btn" onclick="location.href='/cs'">고객센터</button>
	  <button class="gnb-btn" onclick="location.href='/about'">회사소개</button>
	</div>
  </div>

  <div class="layer-2">
    <div id="sub-prod" class="sub-menu-group active">
      <a href="/category/all" class={`sub-btn ${cat === 'all' ? 'active' : ''}`}>전체</a>
      <a href="/category/dew" class={`sub-btn ${cat === 'dew' ? 'active' : ''}`}>노점계</a>
      <a href="/category/aw" class={`sub-btn ${cat === 'aw' ? 'active' : ''}`}>수분활성도측정기</a>
      <a href="/category/moist" class={`sub-btn ${cat === 'moist' ? 'active' : ''}`}>수분측정기</a>
      <a href="/category/flow" class={`sub-btn ${cat === 'flow' ? 'active' : ''}`}>유량계</a>
      <a href="/category/gasana" class={`sub-btn ${cat === 'gasana' ? 'active' : ''}`}>가스분석기</a>
      <a href="/category/gasdet" class={`sub-btn ${cat === 'gasdet' ? 'active' : ''}`}>가스측정기</a>
      <a href="/category/temp" class={`sub-btn ${cat === 'temp' ? 'active' : ''}`}>정밀 온습도계</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="layer-3">
    <div class="search-container" id="searchContainer">
